  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> pace = time &divide; distance. A 5K (3.1&nbsp;mi) in 28:00 is a pace of about <strong>9:01 per mile</strong> (5:36 per km). To convert, 1&nbsp;mile = 1.609&nbsp;km.</p></div>

